Photography for the intake experience.

Nine full frame plates, graded from Sharnay's own work. See section 05 of
../../README.md for the screen each one carries, its grade, its crop, and the
Cloudinary chain that produced it.

Replacing a photograph means dropping a file here under the same name. Any file
missing falls back to the Cloudinary source, then to the near black behind the
backdrop, so the prototype always renders and the type always reads.

These are upscaled from small originals. The camera files should replace them
before anything is designed against them at print size.
